# The log viewer is a local tool and is deliberately not deployed.
#
# The log lives in Neon, not on Vercel, so the same DATABASE_URL that production
# writes to is the one `.env.local` reads. Running the dev server on a laptop
# shows real student data with no public endpoint and no secret to manage. There
# is nothing the deployed copy would add except a way to get it wrong.
demos/ask/log.html
api/log.js
